nts":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A teacher in the school Yukinojou transferred to. He is in charge of educational guidance and various sports classes, a sworn enemy of Serina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a heinous face, merciless personality, and villainous behavior... the worst PE teacher ever. Serina and co gave him the nickname \"Sadistic Shizuka\". Wherever he goes, tears of innocent students are spilled in his wake."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2179"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/453b160d6213620cbd94f870279658c105da02225d232a14c45ea4a9480f4fee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf08b36d62f990e50a35a84348ea6e1765f026e1e2b1160b515744cc057f0925.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2262","characterName":"間部 由希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2262"},"originalCharacterName":"間部 由希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student at Kashima school, Serina's best friend and classmate. The only one member of the Kasuga Independent Gang with common sense. Albeit having a quiet and adult-like personality, she still is unable to stop Serina's rampage, thus always scolded along with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She developed feelings toward Tatsuya since junior high school, but knowing about his unrequited love with Serina, she really can't break the ice. She's great at cleaning and cooking, a family-oriented girl. She has been playing the piano since her childhood and is fond of animals."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2262"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d7f6cbffa79b5acaf25662c57622501383815ad727ce207b3c4ed5cd43f6a23.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/928956fdb314046418cbe8d96790693b0aa8a98da0a3dca1ba5666ec3797a02d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2273","characterName":"新島 早苗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2273"},"originalCharacterName":"新島 早苗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third year student in the Kashima school and Serina's senpai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite Serina having weird acquaintances, Sanae still stands out as one of the most eccentric. She's a character always \"moving at her own pace\", and is totally nuts toward street dancing. She can rarely be seen at school. A really kindhearted girl, but due to her unusual behavior, her only close friends are Serina and co."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2273"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe4356f977f15dddae8150f3e1858169b4dd0a3184c51fc667c23599bafe7c74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78e7fda015df720de70e57bc9a6544e5885e55f926df79637745c188ff2c2450.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2274","characterName":"牧野 詩織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2274"},"originalCharacterName":"牧野 詩織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The homeroom teacher of Serina and co at the Kashima school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A zealous educator who took the job of being the homeroom teacher of the problem child, Yukinojou. Bound by the sense of duty and responsibility, she's definitely an ideal female teacher. She's also smart and has strong maternal instinct. She gently watches over her problematic pupils, while also occasionally helping them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2274"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdbd678e1aa6bd025be6999309a3bda58af3cd290967e356aff916bf32e67079.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6eaa8b0e428a68f4d66785e9b704e8538056c62ab5f4bfc64177141a687e595e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2276","characterName":"杉崎 怜於奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2276"},"originalCharacterName":"杉崎 怜於奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student at Kashima school and the class representative of Serina's class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her cold and harsh personality, she's pretty much isolated in class, despite her outstanding appearance and brilliant mind. Being at full contrast to Serina she doesn't get along well with her, often opposing each other. According to Serina, she's her \"natural enemy\". A complicated girl who can be labeled as a \"cool beauty\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2276"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d84e6d2f2a044b76d67b83eec51c0aa03c4bb525887c872a9ac4e9fa33ac95b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74afad251e688172e067417857033ca501ad37e97c654452d4e1a61df3390dff.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2281","characterName":"小松原 妙子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2281"},"originalCharacterName":"小松原 妙子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first year student in Kashima school and Serina's kouhai. Exaggeratedly cheerful, but at the same time can turn into a crybaby for the smallest reasons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She accidentally became acquainted to Serina via Yukinojou and her childish behavior always rubs Serina the wrong way. Once she's set her mind in something, she goes straight to it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a77e4c5f5e5c684f2ff67518692d31c3ca6d59a87b2d84df581406e549080dd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/195bfd88450617223f08e8ba7823a6407e9d79ac6f7f803e9beae59c7eaf76b3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2288","characterName":"合田 鉄平","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2288"},"originalCharacterName":"合田 鉄平","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student in Kashima school and a member of the Kasuga Independent Gang. The gang meetings always take place at his house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serina's childhood friend, he is secretly head over heels in love for her, thus he and Tatsuya are rivals ever since they were wee lads. But Serina only looks at them as ordinary childhood friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a huge frame, and a hearty lively attitude. His family owns the fish shop in Kashima which he will inherit one day."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2288"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a54200426f8582a728fdf28e0243290b243f776781154a163adc1514e6b40dd1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59717d13e35d5ddcf6dfed59bcb8dfbaf9692b086128aaac47ad3ad7f294dd7e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2289","characterName":"須崎 達也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2289"},"originalCharacterName":"須崎 達也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second year student of Kashima school, Serina's childhood friend and a member of the Kasuga Independent Gang. He's also head over heels in love for Serina. Unlike Teppei, he's a man of intellect, always fighting with Teppei over Serina. He has frameless glasses and is very popular in the school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2289"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30e143a453814b4ed1337846bc622e99e03b2169583dd13efa6462d58853770d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c83964701eaa